        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Torimaanik Daudi Mepiboses",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit Daudi ŋituŋa tema, “Eyai mono ituŋanan eriŋa idoŋit alokal a Saul, ŋini apedori ayoŋ arimaanikin aŋuna a Yonasan a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai nen eketiyan ŋolo anyaritae Siba, ŋolo kitiyae kai a Saul, ido aponi tonyaraunae iŋes neni a Daudi kiŋit erwosit iŋes tema, “Iyoŋ irae Siba a?” Toboŋok iŋes tema, “Ee, ayoŋ lo eketiyan kon!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit erwosit iŋes tema, “Eyai mono ituŋanan eriŋa idoŋit alokal a Saul, ŋini apedori ayoŋ arimaanikin anarimao ka Akuj a?” Toboŋok Siba erwosit tema, “Lokoku a Yonasan bon eriŋa eyai; eŋwalit iŋes ŋakejen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit erwosit iŋes tema, “Ai eyai iŋes?” Toboŋok Siba erwosit tema, “Eyai iŋes kai a Makir alokoku ka Amiel ŋina eyai Lodebar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya nai erwosit iŋes aomere lokoku a Yonasan alokai a Makir alokoku ka Amiel a ŋina ayai Lodebar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ebuni Mepiboses lokoku a Yonasan a ŋolo arae lokoku a Saul neni a Daudi, Kijuuru alokiŋaren Daudi itopoloorit Daudi. Tonyara Daudi iŋes tema, “Mepiboses!” Toboŋok iŋes tema, “Ayai, ayoŋ lo eketiyan kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Daudi neni keŋ, “Nyikuryaniar, anerae akarimaanikini ayoŋ iyoŋ aŋuna a Yonasan a papa kon ekenyakakini ayoŋ iyoŋ akwap a papaa kon a Saul daadaŋ, ido ikimuji iwon kaapei alomesa ke epei a ŋinakoloŋit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijuuru Mepiboses itoodiunit akitopoloorit keŋ Daudi tema, “Ŋae ayoŋ eketiyan kon, eŋok ŋolo atwan irimaanikini iyoŋ?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyarau nai erwosit Siba, eketiyan a Saul, tema neni keŋ, “Ainak ayoŋ lopapait a ekapolon kon ibore daadaŋ ŋini sek arae ŋini a Saul ka ekal keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor iyoŋ ka ŋidwe kon ŋulusapa ta ŋiketiyak kon itaanakinete iŋes emanikor, ido tolemikis iŋes akimuj alomanikor a ŋol, ikotere lopaapit a ekapolon kon eryamuni ibore ŋini imuji. Nai erubakini Mepiboses lopapait a ekapolon kon ikimuji kaapei ka ayoŋ alomesa ke epei a ŋinakoloŋit,” Apaki ŋin, ayakar Siba ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ŋitomon ka ŋikan ka ŋiketiyak ŋatomoniarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Siba neni a erwosit, “Alotooma ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna ikicik iyoŋ ayoŋ eketiyan kon, Ekapolon kaŋ erwosit, etiyae ayoŋ eketiyan kon ŋun.” Kisyak Mepiboses akimuj alomesa a ŋolo emujia Daudi, ikwapei epei a ŋidwe a ŋulusapa a erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar Mepiboses ikoku ŋinisapat ŋini anyaritae Mika, ido arae ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyete alokai a Siba ŋiketiyak a Mepiboses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toruwor Yerusalem eboiyo Mepiboses, anerae arae lomesa ŋolo emujia erwosit emujiananaa Mepiboses a ŋinakoloŋit. Arae Mepiboses ituŋanan ŋini aŋwalito ŋakejen daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
